# revenge.vrs: revenge D18 and D19 (Session 1). rv-test (Faction_Bandits, heat 6, window 900 s, warnAt 2,4, vbloodHeat 10,
# cooldown 5 min; tiers of 2, 3 and 4 bandits whenCleared, AroundPlayer 15-25 m, Hunt 40, scoreboard) gathers heat from
# Chaos's kills of native bandits at the camp mark ${CAMP} (prefab ${BANDIT}, `.devkill <guid> <radius> <max>`): our own
# spawned bandits add none; warning 1 of 2 at 2 and 2 of 2 at 4, each shown privately in chat; at 6 Chaos is due. At home
# (claimed territory) the start is held; at the pond it starts within 10 s with the alert and the private line, tier 1
# stands within 25 m; each tier killed brings the next; "all waves defeated (3 of 3 waves)" with the private end line;
# kills within the 5 min cooldown warn no more.
# Needs: the step 2 Release DLL; NyarDevTools (.devgo, .devkill with max, .devmark) and DevChatEcho; rv-test enabled and
# rv-test0, bw-test and every FactionKills definition disabled; Scoreboard.IncludeAdmins true; marks home, pond and
# ${CAMP}; Chaos invulnerable (`ToggleInvulnerable true`, never false). Run: --var CAMP=<mark> --var BANDIT=<guid>
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .nyar event reload
expect-log events: reloaded
# D18: our own spawned bandits add no heat
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 3
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Bandit_Thug 2
expect-log spawned CHAR_Bandit_Thug timeout=20
wait 4
mark
chat .devkill -301730941 30
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=2
expect-no-log revenge rv-test timeout=6
# D18: native kills, two at a time
chat .devgo ${CAMP}
expect-log \[DEV TP\] ${CAMP}
wait 4
mark
chat .devkill ${BANDIT} 40 2
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=2
expect-log revenge rv-test: warning 1 of 2 timeout=10
expect-chat have noticed your killing
shot chat rv-warning1
mark
chat .devkill ${BANDIT} 40 2
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=2
expect-log revenge rv-test: warning 2 of 2 timeout=10
expect-chat are gathering against you
shot chat rv-warning2
mark
chat .devkill ${BANDIT} 40 2
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=2
expect-log revenge rv-test due timeout=10
# D19: held in claimed territory
console TPHome
wait 3
expect-log revenge rv-test: held \(territory\) timeout=15
expect-no-log event rv-test started timeout=30
# D19: outside, it starts within 10 s
mark
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
expect-log event rv-test started by Revenge timeout=12
expect-log announced to [0-9]+: The Bandits (swear revenge|gather to hunt) timeout=10
expect-log spawned CHAR_Bandit_Thug for rv-test timeout=30
expect-chat The Bandits come for you
shot chat rv-start
wait 4
chat .nyar debug here 25
expect-reply rv-test
shot full rv-tier1
chat .devkill -301730941 40
expect-log event rv-test wave 1 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event rv-test wave 2/3 around a player timeout=30
expect-log spawned CHAR_Bandit_Hunter for rv-test timeout=30
wait 5
chat .devkill -301730941 40
chat .devkill -1301144178 40
expect-log event rv-test wave 2 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event rv-test wave 3/3 around a player timeout=30
expect-log spawned CHAR_Bandit_Hunter for rv-test timeout=30
wait 5
chat .devkill -301730941 40
chat .devkill -1301144178 40
expect-log event rv-test ended: all waves defeated \(3 of 3 waves\) timeout=30
expect-log revenge rv-test ended: all waves defeated timeout=5
wait 3
expect-chat revenge is spent
shot chat rv-end
# D19: kills within the 5 min cooldown warn no more
chat .devgo ${CAMP}
expect-log \[DEV TP\] ${CAMP}
wait 4
mark
chat .devkill ${BANDIT} 60 4
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=[1-4]
expect-no-log revenge rv-test: warning timeout=8
console TPHome
